#: ../../benchmarks.rst:568
msgid ""
"In forward-auth mode the p50 stays between 24 and 30 us at every rate. "
"The p99 stays at or under 51 us up to 150,000 requests per second, and "
"the p99.9 at or under 74 us. The daemon spends 13.48 to 16.92 us of CPU "
"per request."
